#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&marble; is a geographical atlas and a virtual desktop globe which lets you "
"quickly explore other places on our home planet. You can use &marble; to "
"look up places, to easily create maps, measure distances and to retrieve "
"detail information about locations that you have just heard about in the "
"news or on the Internet. The user interface is clean, simple and easy to use."
msgstr ""

